# macOS .pkg packaging.
#
# Created in M5 (macOS adapter milestone).
# Tauri's bundle.targets=["dmg","app"] generates .app + .dmg; this folder holds:
#   - postinstall scripts (LaunchAgent installation, command-line tool symlink)
#   - entitlements.plist for code signing (when Apple Developer ID acquired)
#   - distribution.xml for installer customization
